01:02:40.820 --> 01:02:53.100
<v Brian Timpone>If there's a paragraph about a person, the paragraph is technically written by someone in the Philippines, but not written. It's like they have to type it. They have to type out who the person is, right? So they have to know how to write.
<v Brian Timpone>如果有一个关于某人的段落，这个段落技术上是由在菲律宾的某人写的，但没写。就像他们必须输入它。他们必须输入那个人是谁，对吧？所以他们必须知道如何写。

01:02:53.100 --> 01:03:07.980
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

01:03:07.980 --> 01:03:12.980
